# Every text file is LF in the index and in every checkout, on every platform. Storyboards,
# take fixtures, goldens and go:embed'd files are read byte-for-byte, and a core.autocrlf=true
# checkout (Windows CI) would otherwise put a carriage return on each line.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixtures and assets are never converted: a CRLF byte pair inside an image or a font
# would be rewritten on `git add` and corrupt the file.
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
.capcom/issues/**/*.md merge=capcom-log
